sequenceDiagram
    participant Customer as KhachHang
    participant App as UngDung
    participant Camera as Camera
    participant Detector as BoNhanDien

    Customer->>App: Mo chuc nang chup khuon mat
    App->>Camera: Kich hoat camera preview
    Camera-->>App: Luong video

    loop Lap den khi phat hien thanh cong
        App->>Detector: Gui frame hien tai
        alt Phat hien thanh cong
            Detector-->>App: Khuon mat hop le
            App->>Customer: Xac nhan & chup anh
            note over App,Detector:"success" de thoat vong lap
        else Khong phat hien / Khong hop le
            Detector-->>App: Khong co mat / ngoai vung / goc sai
            App->>Customer: Yeu cau chinh huong, anh sang, khoang cach
        end
    end

    App-->>Customer: Hoan tat quy trinh
